<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Which vectors are unit vectors</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Is each vector a unit vector?</p><div>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v1[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v1[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v1[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><div>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v2[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v2[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v2[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div><div>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v3[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v3[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v3[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div><div>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v4[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v4[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v4[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>A unit vector has magnitude 1, so \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1\). Adding the components is not the test.</p><ul><li>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v1[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v1[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v1[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = {@sq1@}\), so it is [[if test="is1"]]a unit vector[[else]]not a unit vector[[/if]].</li><li>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v2[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v2[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v2[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = {@sq2@}\), so it is [[if test="is2"]]a unit vector[[else]]not a unit vector[[/if]].</li><li>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v3[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v3[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v3[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = {@sq3@}\), so it is [[if test="is3"]]a unit vector[[else]]not a unit vector[[/if]].</li><li>\(\begin{pmatrix} \displaystyle{@v4[1]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v4[2]@} \\ \displaystyle{@v4[3]@} \end{pmatrix}\): \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = {@sq4@}\), so it is [[if test="is4"]]a unit vector[[else]]not a unit vector[[/if]].</li></ul>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>4</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
